DATA NOTICE

This software consumes the StatsBomb Open Data repository
(https://github.com/statsbomb/open-data), which StatsBomb makes available free
of charge for non-commercial use. The lionelmessi package does not bundle or
redistribute any proprietary event data; it fetches open data on demand and
caches it locally. Users are responsible for complying with the StatsBomb Open
Data terms and with StatsBomb's user agreement.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Lionel Messi,
FC Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain, Inter Miami CF, or StatsBomb.
